{"id": "guodian-yi.001", "witness": "guodian-yi", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "1", "text": "绐（治）人事天，莫若啬。夫唯啬，是以○（早），是以○（早）备（服）是胃（谓）……", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/乙/简1"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 38, "end": 40}]}
{"id": "guodian-yi.002", "witness": "guodian-yi", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "2", "text": "不=克=则莫智（知）其亘（恒）〈亟（极）〉，莫智（知）其亘〈亟（极）〉可以又（有）○（国）。又（有）○（国）之母，可以长……，", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/乙/简2"}, "status": "unverified", "marks": [{"type": "repeat", "as_source": "=", "offset": 1}, {"type": "repeat", "as_source": "=", "offset": 3}], "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 60, "end": 62}]}
{"id": "guodian-yi.003", "witness": "guodian-yi", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "3", "text": "长生○（旧=久）视之道也。 学者日益，为道者日员（损）。员（损）之或员（损），以至亡为", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/乙/简3"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-yi.004", "witness": "guodian-yi", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "4", "text": "也，亡为而亡不为。○（绝）学亡○（忧），唯与可（呵），相去几可（何）？○（美）与亚（恶），相去可（何）若？", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/乙/简4"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-yi.005", "witness": "guodian-yi", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "5", "text": "人之所○（畏），亦不可以不○（畏）。人○（宠）辱若缨（惊）。贵大患若身。可（何）胃（谓）○（宠）", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/乙/简5"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-yi.006", "witness": "guodian-yi", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "6", "text": "辱？○（宠）为下也。得之若缨（惊），○（失）之若缨（惊），是胃（谓）○（宠）辱缨（惊）。□□□□□", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/乙/简6"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 44, "end": 49}]}
{"id": "guodian-yi.007", "witness": "guodian-yi", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "7", "text": "若身？○（吾）所以又（有）大患者，为○（吾）又（有）身。○（及）○（吾）亡身，或可（何）□□□□□□", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/乙/简7"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 44, "end": 50}]}
{"id": "guodian-yi.008", "witness": "guodian-yi", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "8", "text": "为天下，若可以○（託）天下矣。○（爱）以身为天下，若可（何）以○天下矣。", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/乙/简8"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-yi.009", "witness": "guodian-yi", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "9", "text": "上士昏（闻）道，○（勤）能行于其中。中士昏（闻）道，若昏（闻）若亡。下士昏（闻）道，大○（笑）之。弗大", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/乙/简9"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-yi.010", "witness": "guodian-yi", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "10", "text": "○（笑），不足以为道矣。是以建言又（有）之：明道女（如）○（○），○（夷）道□□□", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/乙/简10"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 38, "end": 41}]}
{"id": "guodian-yi.011", "witness": "guodian-yi", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "11", "text": "道若退。上○（德）女（如）浴（谷），大白女（如）辱，○（广）○（德）女（如）不足，建○（德）女（如）□□贞（真）女（如）愉。", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/乙/简11"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 50, "end": 52}]}
{"id": "guodian-yi.012", "witness": "guodian-yi", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "12", "text": "大方亡禺（隅），大器曼成，大音祗圣（声），天象亡○（形），道……", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/乙/简12"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 30, "end": 32}]}
{"id": "guodian-yi.013", "witness": "guodian-yi", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "13", "text": "闷（闭）其门，赛（塞）其○（兑），终身不○。启其○（兑），赛其事，终身不○。大成若", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/乙/简13"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-yi.014", "witness": "guodian-yi", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "14", "text": "○（缺），其○（用）不敝。大○（盈）若中（盅），其甬（用）不○（穷）。大○（巧）若○（拙），大成若诎，大植（直）", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/乙/简14"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-yi.015", "witness": "guodian-yi", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "15", "text": "若屈。○（燥）○（胜）苍（沧），青（清）○（胜）然（热），清清（静）为天下定（正）。善建者不拔，善○者", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/乙/简15"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-yi.016", "witness": "guodian-yi", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "16", "text": "不兑（脱），子孙以其祭祀不屯。攸（修）之身，其○（德）乃贞（真）。攸（修）之○（家），其○（德）又（有）舍（餘）。攸（修）", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/乙/简16"}, "status": "unverified"}
{"id": "guodian-yi.017", "witness": "guodian-yi", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "17", "text": "之向（乡），其○（德）乃长。攸（修）之邦，其○（德）乃奉（丰）。攸（修）之天下□□□□□□□", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/乙/简17"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 39, "end": 46}]}
{"id": "guodian-yi.018", "witness": "guodian-yi", "unit_type": "slip", "unit_no": "18", "text": "○（家），以向（乡）观向（乡），以邦观邦，以天下观天下。○（吾）可（何）以智（知）天□□□□□", "source_ref": {"source": "wikisource-guodian", "raw_file": "data/raw/wikisource-guodian/2026-10-14.html", "locator": "老子（甲乙丙）/乙/简18"}, "status": "unverified", "damage": [{"kind": "missing", "start": 42, "end": 47}]}
